        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward: Every Purchase Costs Points</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defend Enfora Star space station against droid swarms, but here's the twist: every defense or upgrade purchase reduces your high score. Do you play it safe with heavy defenses, or risk everything for maximum points?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Arcade-Style Space Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your starfighter around the besieged station in intense retro-style action. Dash through enemy formations, collect power-ups and weapon upgrades while evading incoming fire and destroying droids one by one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Defense Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform the battleground by constructing defenses. Deploy walls to create choke points, install automated turrets for additional firepower, and recruit allied drones to fight alongside you. But remember - every credit spent is a point lost. The ultimate challenge isn't just surviving the waves, but mastering the risk-reward balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552750/extras/73f178b521e2a8c26ddb658880bc54c2.poster.avif?t=1767118350\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552750/extras/73f178b521e2a8c26ddb658880bc54c2.webm?t=1767118350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552750/extras/73f178b521e2a8c26ddb658880bc54c2.mp4?t=1767118350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Ultimate Arcade Dilemma</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How much are you willing to sacrifice for victory? This isn't just about building a fortress - it's about achieving the perfect balance between combat, clever defenses, and score optimization. Will you emerge as a cautious survivor or a legendary point-chaser?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Risk/reward scoring system - every purchase reduces your final score</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Classic arcade shooter experience</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Intense fast-paced space combat</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Multiple weapons &amp; power-ups</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Weapon damage &amp; armor upgrade systems</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Defensive building system with turrets</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Recruit allied drones</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552750/extras/a8592e1330da141074f7ced3e506f42f.poster.avif?t=1767118350\" width=720 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552750/extras/a8592e1330da141074f7ced3e506f42f.webm?t=1767118350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552750/extras/a8592e1330da141074f7ced3e506f42f.mp4?t=1767118350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
