ut achieving the perfect balance between combat, clever defenses, and score optimization. Will you emerge as a cautious survivor or a legendary point-chaser?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Risk/reward scoring system - every purchase reduces your final score</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Classic arcade shooter experience</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Intense fast-paced space combat</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Multiple weapons &amp; power-ups</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Weapon damage &amp; armor upgrade systems</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Defensive building system with turrets</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Recruit allied drones</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552750/extras/a8592e1330da141074f7ced3e506f42f.poster.avif?t=1767118350\" width=720 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552750/extras/a8592e1330da141074f7ced3e506f42f.webm?t=1767118350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552750/extras/a8592e1330da141074f7ced3e506f42f.mp4?t=1767118350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
